We have brought in many progressive industrial policies in the last two years. If you bring forward a good idea, I am ready to adopt it immediately, this is the biggest advantage we have.

We are also working on different policies, one being: 'One family, one entrepreneur'. Our aim is to promote more and more entrepreneurs. From sixth class onwards, I want to introduce entrepreneurial skills and AI in the curriculum to inculcate these skills in young mind to promote entrepreneurship.

N. Chandrababu Naidu, Hon’ble Chief Minister of Andhra Pradesh, and Co-Chairman, 31st CII Partnership Summit, at the Curtain Raiser event of the 31st Partnership Summit held in New Delhi on 8 October 2026. #CIIPartnershipSummit2026 #CIIPS2026 @ncbn @AndhraPradeshCM 

